WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.700
Aren Vale. The kingdom kept one light for you.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.700
Not to make you whole. To show you where you broke.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:19.700
Your blade remembers what you chose to forget.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:26.700
You saw the sun rise over a kingdom history denies.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.700
Follow the first buried Crown Path.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.700
Remember before the Eclipse remembers you.
